//
// mistral7b_v03_q4nx verify gate: top-k token-level inclusion, NPU vs the pinned HF bf16
// checkpoint, 2 prompts x 32 greedy tokens, k=5 (verify/verify_runner.py
// through verify_adapter.py). The production path: the fused prefill for the
// prompt, its KV rows handed to the fused decode. The adapter runs the P1024
// configuration, whose KV capacity of 2048 covers the runner's sequences.
// run_npu2_verify_p*.lit is the fixed-input gate of each native configuration.
//
// The tests of this directory share affine-build: weights are packed once.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, llvm_link_pre23, hfweights_mistralai_mistral_7b_instruct_v0_3
//
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile weights BUILD_DIR=affine-build PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile P=1024 BUILD_DIR=affine-build PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify BUILD_DIR=affine-build PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
